OL,3,ACounter-terror police lead
OL,4,Ainvestigation into major incident near
OL,5,ARAF base, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FCounter-terror police are leading the
OL,8,Finvestigation into a major incident
OL,9,Fnear RAF Fairford - watch live footage
OL,10,Fof wheeled robots approaching vans at
OL,11,Fthe scene above
OL,13,FSeveral men have been arrested on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of offences under the
OL,15,FExplosives Act, Gloucestershire police
OL,16,Fsay - the force is expected to give a
OL,17,Fnews conference shortly
OL,19,FResidents in the village of Whelford,
OL,20,Fnear the base, have been evacuated -
OL,21,Fwhat we know so far
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
