OL,6,
OL,7,F"It all happened very quickly. We just
OL,8,Fpacked our stuff up and came here,"
OL,9,Fsays one of the evacuated residents
OL,11,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,12,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,13,Fmilitary, as the country's Air Force
OL,14,Fsay they "remain vigilant" following
OL,15,Fthe incident
